    "P-SUPPORT": "Engine support is plan: untap/haste for a {T} engine, cost reducers for a cast engine, graveyard fillers for a graveyard engine, legend-breaking clones, draw-punishers for a gift engine, castable spell faces as fuel",
    "P-SUBSTRATE": "A second engine or conditional payoff counts only if the deck supplies what it needs",
    "P-CUT-QUALITY": "Surplus cuts come from the bottom of a class; top-quality cards and land-light ramp are kept",
    "P-COLOR": "Category targets follow the colors: no Counterspell target without blue"
